---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/design-lab/why-book-direct/"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
seoIndexable: false
pageTitle: "Why Book Direct Receipt Design Lab"
pageDescription: "Preview-only Seascape direct-booking receipt comparison for the homepage Why Book Direct section."
pageAuthor: "Seascape Vacations Team"
pageImage: "https://seascape-vacations.com/images/seascape-og-default.jpg"
navActive: "home"
navButtonHref: "https://book.seascape-vacations.com"
navButtonLabel: "Book Direct"
navButtonTarget: "_blank"
navButtonRel: "noopener noreferrer"
headExtra: |
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/design-lab-why-book-direct.css">
---
{% from "partials/ui-icon.njk" import uiIcon %}

<section class="direct-lab-hero" aria-labelledby="direct-lab-hero-title">
  <div class="direct-lab-hero__image" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="direct-lab-hero__inner">
    <p class="direct-lab-eyebrow">Book direct preview</p>
    <h1 id="direct-lab-hero-title">Why Book Direct</h1>
    <p>Same Seascape homes, local support, and clearer pricing before the guest leaves the site.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="direct-receipt" aria-labelledby="direct-receipt-title">
  <div class="direct-receipt__shell">
    <div class="direct-receipt__intro">
      <p class="direct-receipt__eyebrow">Why Book Direct</p>
      <h2 id="direct-receipt-title">Same home. Same dates. $386 less.</h2>
      <p class="direct-receipt__lede">The savings are not a vague promise. They come from removing platform fees and keeping the booking relationship with the local team that actually hosts the stay.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="direct-receipt__comparison" aria-label="Direct booking savings comparison">
      <article class="receipt-card receipt-card--platform" aria-labelledby="platform-receipt-title">
        <div class="receipt-card__topline">
          <p id="platform-receipt-title">Booking on Airbnb</p>
          <span>Estimated</span>
        </div>
        <div class="receipt-card__rows">
          <div class="receipt-row">
            <span>7 nights at $450</span>
            <strong>$3,150</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt-row receipt-row--fee">
            <span>Airbnb service fee</span>
            <strong>$441</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt-row receipt-row--fee">
            <span>Cleaning fee with platform markup</span>
            <strong>$245</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt-row">
            <span>Occupancy taxes</span>
            <strong>$221</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="receipt-total">
          <span>Total</span>
          <strong>$3,721</strong>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="savings-lockup" aria-label="Savings summary">
        <span class="savings-lockup__label">You save</span>
        <strong>$386</strong>
        <span class="savings-lockup__note">about 10% on the same stay</span>
      </div>

      <article class="receipt-card receipt-card--direct" aria-labelledby="direct-receipt-card-title">
        <div class="receipt-card__topline">
          <p id="direct-receipt-card-title">Booking direct</p>
          <span>Seascape</span>
        </div>
        <div class="receipt-card__rows">
          <div class="receipt-row">
            <span>7 nights at $450</span>
            <strong>$3,150</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt-row receipt-row--zero">
            <span>Platform service fee</span>
            <strong>$0</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt-row">
            <span>Cleaning fee at actual cost</span>
            <strong>$185</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt-row">
            <span>Occupancy taxes</span>
            <strong>$221</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="receipt-total receipt-total--direct">
          <span>Total</span>
          <strong>$3,335</strong>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="direct-proof">
      <div class="direct-proof__item">
        <span>{{ uiIcon('check', 'direct-proof__icon') }}</span>
        <p>No platform service fee</p>
      </div>
      <div class="direct-proof__item">
        <span>{{ uiIcon('phone', 'direct-proof__icon') }}</span>
        <p>Local host support before and during the stay</p>
      </div>
      <div class="direct-proof__item">
        <span>{{ uiIcon('star', 'direct-proof__icon direct-proof__icon--star') }}</span>
        <p>Five-star homes guests already review by name</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="direct-review">
      <p>"Hands down the best rental we've ever experienced. The place was spotlessly clean and the hosts responded to every question immediately."</p>
      <footer>Kurt Jones · Dockside Dreams</footer>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>
